oṃ namo kulavāgīśvaryai || 

oṃ devīṃ kadambavanagāmaruṇatrikoṇasaṃsthāṃ sitāṃ sitavarāmbujakarṇikāsthām | 
satpustakākṣavalayānvitapāṇipadmāṃ vāgīśvarīṃ kulaguruṃ praṇamāmi nityam || 

ullikhantīṃ jagaccittramannullekhepi śāṅkarīm | sarvasiddhipradāṃ śaktiṃ tripurāmbā namāmyaham || 

hrīṃ vāgīśāya vidmahe klīṃ kāmeśāya dhīṃ sauḥ tannaḥ śaktiḥ pracoḥ || gāyatrīṃ triḥ paṭhitvā || 

oṃ hrīṃ phaṭ ityastrapātraṃ svadakṣe | tena sarvadravyaprokṣaṇam || 

aiṃ trikoṇapīṭhapāda ityāsane puṣpaṃ datvā tatropaviśya prāṇāyāmādividhāya svānusandhānād 
dvādaśakalānyāsaḥ || 

oṃ aiṃ hṛ | oṃ klīṃ śi | oṃ sauḥ śi | oṃ aiṃ kṛ | oṃ klīṃ ne | oṃ sauḥ astrāḥ || 

aiṃ aiśānyambā pāda (* * * * * * * * * * * * * *)(?) pāda hṛdi | aiṃ vāmāmbāpāda kuṇḍalinyām | 


aiṃ ambāmbāpāda jīvadhāmni || iti vāgbhava kalāpañcakam || 

klīṃ vaindavyambāpāda | bindusthāne | klīṃ mohinyambāpāda bhrūmadhye klīṃ aindryambāpāda hṛdi | klīṃ 
kāmāmbāpāda guhye | iti kāmakalānyāsaḥ || sauḥ visargakalāmbāpāda mūrdhni | sauḥ triśūlakalāmbāpāda | 
nāḍitraye | sauḥ sañjīvanakalāmbāpāda | jīvadhāmni || iti śaktikalātrayanyāsaḥ || 

hrīṃ phaṭ karaśarīroddīpanam dehaśuddhiḥ abhinavadehotpādanam karamūlamadhyānteṣu vāgbhavakalānyāsaḥ || 
gudanābhikuhareṣu caitad vījanyāsaḥ || klīṃ phaḍiti digbandhanam hūmityavaguṇṭhanam | ityamṛtīkaraṇam || 
tataḥ prāṇāyāmapūrvaṃ śoṣaṇādidhāraṇādibhirdivyadehaḥ karaṇagaṇasampramoṣād devīmavyaktarūpāṃ | 

nādasvabhāvāṃ sthūlāṃ pustakākṣasūtravalayāṃ kadambamālābharaṇāṃ mātṛkāṃ udgirantīṃ sañcitya 
variṣṭhairmānasaiḥ padārthaiḥ pūjayet | iti manoyāgaṃ vidhāya pātraṃ prakālya tribhirupayuktairbījaiḥ 
saṃskṛtya svajātyucitairdravyaiḥ pūrayet | tatra tripañcaka krameṇa pūjayet | tataḥ svātmapūjāṃ vidhāya 
bāhyayāgaṃ vidadhyāt || 

aiṃ hrīṃ kāmadevanāthapāda | aiṃ hrīṃ ratyambāpāda | oṃ vasantanātha pāda | oṃ prītyambāpāda | oṃ 
udyānanāthapāda || dvāravāmadakṣiṇamadhyeṣu sampūjya vāgbhavabījamuccārya || 

aiṃ tripuravāgīśagurunāthapāda | klīṃ tripurasundaraparamagurunāthapāda | sauḥ 
tripuravīraparamācāryagurunāthapāda || 

iti gurutraye vyomadakṣiṇataḥ pūjyam | aiṃ ṣaṣṭheśanāthapāda | klīṃ mitreśanāthapāda | 


sauḥ uḍḍīśanāthapāda || 

iti vyomavāme siddhatrayam || atha vyomapaścādbhāge | 

aiṃ hrīṃ kāmeśvaryambāpāda | aiṃ hrīṃ sumanādevyambāpāda | aiṃ hrīṃ saubhāgyadevyambāpāda | aiṃ 
hrīṃ ānandādevyambāpāda | aiṃ hrīṃ manmathādevyambāpāda | aiṃ hrīṃ pradyumnādevyambāpāda | aiṃ hrīṃ 
mahādevanāthapāda | aiṃ hrīṃ anaṅgādevanāthapāda | aiṃ hrīṃ vāmadevanāthapāda | aiṃ hrīṃ 
śaṅkarānandanāthapāda | aiṃ hrīṃ sāmbhavajñānānandanāthapāda | aiṃ hrīṃ suguptānandanāthapāda | aiṃ 
hrīṃ musvalānandanātha | aiṃ hrīṃ sugurunātha || 

iti siddhamānavaughāḥ | 

tato bahiraṣṭau mātṝḥ pūjayet || 

aiṃ hrīṃ brāhmyambāpāda | oṃ māheśvaryambāpāda | oṃ kaumāryambāpāda | oṃ vaiṣṇavyambā0 | oṃ 
vārāhyambā0 | oṃ aindryambā0 | oṃ aiśānyambā0 | oṃ āgneyyambā0 || 

iti svāgrādārabhyavāmāvartakrameṇa pūjyāḥ || 

aiṃ trikoṇapīṭhapāda aiṃ ambujapīṭhapāda | aiṃ karṇikāgrapīṭhapāda | aiṃ kambalagolapīṭhapāda || 
ityāsanaṃ dalatrayasyāntaḥ saṃpūjya | yonimudrābandhena devīmavyaktarūpāṃ kadambagolakākārāṃ sūkṣmāṃ 
nādamayīṃ | sthūlāṃ pustakākṣasūttrahastāṃ kadambamālābharaṇāṃ mātṛkāmudgirantīṃ tridhā sañcitya 
kadambamadhye anacche pūjayet || 

tato mūlam || 

aiṃ klīṃ sauḥ kulavāgīśvaryambāpāda || iti mūlam || 

tryaśrāntatriviṣṭatridalasaroje pratyekaṃ dalatrayasya pūrvadakṣiṇavāmeṣu karṇikāyāmupari ca pañcasu 
sthāneṣu tripañcaka kramaḥ pūjyaḥ || 

aiṃ paścimābhimukha liṅgapāda | klīṃ yonimudrāmbāpāda | sauḥ trisrotaḥ pīṭhapāda | pūrve || 

aiṃ hṛdayasvayambhūliṅgapāda | klīṃ kṣobhiṇī 


mudrāmbāpāda | sauḥ uḍḍiyānapīṭhapāda | dakṣe aiṃ bindubāṇaliṅgapāda | klīṃ drāviṇīmudrāmbāpāda 
| sauḥ pūrṇagiripīṭhapāda | vāme || aiṃ itaraliṅgapīṭhapāda | klīṃ sarvāṅgāsundarī mudrāmbāpāda | 
sauḥ kāmarūpapīṭhapāda | aiṃ akulākāśa liṅgapāda | klīṃ nirālambāmudrāmbāpāda | sauḥ 
jālandharapīṭhapāda || 

iti karṇikopari | iti tripañcakakrameṇa pūjayet || 

astrārgha pātrāt pādyādi ete naivābhyukṣitaṃ bhakṣyabhojyādi naivedyaṃ dattvā tṛptāṃ devīṃ dhyātvā 
amṛtamudrāṃ baddhvā japaḥ kāryaḥ || 

vaṭukayoginībhyo baliḥ | oṃ aiṃ īṃ klīṃ blūṃ saḥ saḥ samayāmbāpāda | iti samayāṃ paṭhitvā 
nirālambamudrāṃ baddhvā devīṃ svadhāmni visarjayet || 

[iti kulavāgīśvarī pūjanam] || 

[atha durgāpūjanam] || 

oṃ hrīṃ duṃ siṃhāsanāya namaḥ | oṃ hrīṃ duṃ padmāsanāya namaḥ | oṃ hrīṃ duṃ durgāmūrtaye namaḥ | iti 
mūrtimantraḥ || 

sāṅgamantra nyāsapūrvaṃ svātmapūjāṃvidhāya || śaṅkharicāpa śarabhinnakarāṃ trinettrāṃ 
tira(?)detarāṃśu kalāyā vikasatkirīṭām | siṃha sthitāmasurasiddhanutāṃ ca durgāṃ dūrvānibhāṃ 
duritaduḥkhaharīṃ namāmi || 

iti dhyātvā || 

oṃ hrāṃ hrīṃ duṃ sakalabhayaharī durgāsukhaṃ dadārtu svāhā || 

iti mūlena pūjayet || 

tato hrāmītyaṅgāni naivedyaṃ nivedayet visarjayet | oṃ hrīṃ duṃ durgāyai namaḥ || oṃ hrīṃ hṛ | duṃ śi | 
duḥ śi | gā ka yai ne | namaḥ astrā0 || 

[atha vanadurgāpūjanam] || 

kālameghasannibhāṃkalitāndhacandraśiroḍahāṃ bālanettravibhūṣaṇāṃ bhayadāyi siṃhaneṣeduṣīm | 


śaṅkhacakrakṛpāṇa(khaḍga)kheṭakaśāṅga(?)bāṇakaroṭikā (kapāla) 
sthūlavāhibhujāṃbhajejitākhilāsurasainikām | 

iti dhyānam || 

asya śrīvanadurgāmantrasya | araṇyaka ṛṣiḥ anuṣṭupchandaḥ | 

śrīvanadurgādevatā iṣṭasiddhyarthaṃ viniyogaḥ | 

ādau tāvadaṅgaṣaṭkena mūlena ca nyāsaṃ kuryāt | 

ātmapūjāṃ kuryāt | 

oṃ hrīṃ duṃ icchāśaktyai namaḥ | oṃ hrīṃ duṃ jñānaśaktyai namaḥ | oṃ kriyāśaktyai namaḥ | oṃ kāminyai 
namaḥ | oṃ kātyāyanyai namaḥ | oṃ ratipriyāyai namaḥ | oṃ ānandāyai namaḥ | oṃ manonmanyai namaḥ | 

iti pīṭha śaktayaḥ || 

oṃ āṃ prabhāyai namaḥ | īṃ māyāyai namaḥ | eṃ sūkṣmāya namaḥ | aiṃ viśuddhāyai namaḥ | oṃ nandinyai 
namaḥ | auṃ suprabhāyai namaḥ | aṃ jayāyai namaḥ | aḥ sarvasiddhipradāyai namaḥ | iti vā pīṭhaśaktayaḥ 
pūjyāḥ || 

atha dvārapūjā | 

oṃ gāṃ gaṇapataye namaḥ | vāṃ vaṭukāya kṣāṃ kṣettrapālāya | 

śaṃśaṅkhanidhaye | paṃ padmanidhaye | jmryūṃ jayāyai | bhmryūṃ vijayāyai | oṃ duṃ dhanurdharāyai namaḥ | 
iti dvārapūjā | 

madhye | 

oṃ hrīṃ hūṃ mahiṣāsurāya namaḥ | oṃ hrīṃ hūṃ mahāsiṃhāya namaḥ | 

tadupari bhagavatīṃ pūjayet | 

uttiṣṭhapuruṣi kiṃ svapiṣi bhayaṃ me samupasthitaṃ yadi śaktyamaśakyaṃ vā tanme bhagavati śamaya svāhā | 
varṇāḥ <37> | 

uttiṣṭha puruṣi hṛda | kiṃ svapiṣiśi | bhayaṃ me samupasthitaṃ śikhā | yadi śakyamaśakyaṃ vā kava | tanme 
bhagavati ne | śamaya svāhā astrā0 | ityaṅga ṣaṭkam | 

athaṣaṭkoṇe | 

brahma sarasvatībhyāṃ namaḥ | lakṣmīnārāyaṇābhyāṃ namaḥ | gaurīśaṅkarābhyāṃ namaḥ | 

iti pṛṣṭhe | 

oṃ hrīṃ duṃ madhukaiṭabhavidrāviṇyai namaḥ | oṃ mahiṣāsuramardinyai namaḥ | oṃ sumbhanisumbhamathinyai namaḥ 
| ityadhaḥ | athāṣṭadaleṣu dalamūleṣu | oṃ 


āryāyai namaḥ | durgāyai bhadrāyai bhadrakālyai ambikāyai kṣemāyai vedagarbhāyai kṣemaṅkaryai | ādau 
daleṣu | śaṅkhāya namaḥ | cakrāya khaḍgāya kheṭāya bāṇāya dhanuṣe śūlāya kapālāya namaḥ | 

atha dalāgreṣu mātaraḥ || 

oṃ hrīṃ duṃ āṃ brāhmyai namaḥ | ḷṃ īṃ māheśvaryai | ḷṃ ūṃ kaumāryai | ḷṃ eṃ vaiṣṇavyai | ḷṃ 
ḹṃ vārāhyai ḷṃ aiṃ aindrai ḷṃ auṃ cāmuṇḍāyai ḷṃ aḥ mahālakṣmyai namaḥ | 

tato lokapālāḥ | 

lūṃ indrāya vajrahastāya namaḥ | rūṃ agnaye śaktihastāyetyādi | oṃ hūṃ śivadūtyai namaḥ | oṃ hrīṃ 
kṣāṃ krāṃ śarebhyo namaḥ | oṃ hrīṃ śrīṃ duṃ jvale jvāle śūlini duṣṭagaralaṃ hūṃ phaṭ svāhā || 

[iti vana durgāpūjanaṃ samāptam] || 

[atha gaurīpūjanam] || 

sāme bhavatu suprītā gaurīśikharavāsinī | ugreṇa tapasā labdho yayā paśupatiḥ patiḥ | 

śūlākṣasūttramakurakumbhānsavyāpasavyayoḥ | siṃhasthāṃ bibhratīṃ devīṃ nettradvitayaśālinīm | 
prottaṅgastananamrāṅgīṃ vilolavilasatkacām | dviraṣṭavatsarākārāṃ devīṃ bhagavatīṃ numaḥ || 

padmāsanāyanamaḥ | gauryāsanāyanamaḥ | oṃ gauṃ gaurīmūrtaye namaḥ | 

tadupari | 

oṃ hrīṃ saḥ mahāgauri rudradayite svāhā | 

iti mūlam | 

gāṃ hṛ gīṃ śi | gūṃ śi | gaiṃ ka | gauṃ ne | gaḥ a | 

ityāṅgāni 

sīṃ jñānaśaktaye namaḥ | suṃ kriyāśaktaye namaḥ | 

tato lokapālāḥ samantrāḥ pūrvoktāḥ | 

spheṃ subhagāyai | sphiṃ lalitāyai | sphuṃ kāpālinyai | spheṃ kāmamālinyai namaḥ | lūṃ indrāyetyādi | 

[iti gaurīpūjanam] || 

oṃ namaḥ siddhalakṣmyai || 

devīṃ śuddhasphaṭikadhavalāṃ pañcavaktrāṃ trinettrāṃ dorbhiryuktāṃ daśabhirabhitaḥ śobhitāṃ 
ratnahāraiḥ | 


dakṣiṇa pārśve 

<1> kādyaṃ muṇḍaṃ <2> sṛṇimamasṛṇaṃ <3> śūlamacchāccha(?)dhāraṃ <4> sārātsāraṃ <5> 
varamanavaradakṣahastairvahantīm || <1> || 

vāmapārśve 

<1> utkhaṭvāṅgaṃ kaṭhinavikaṭāṃ <2> ṭaṅkamūrjasviṭaṅkapāśaṃ <3> jñānāmṛtarasamayaṃ <5> pustakaṃ <6> 
cābhayaṃ ca | 

kāmaṃ vāmaiḥ śubhakaratalairbibhratīṃ viśvavandyāṃ padmapretoparikṛtapadāṃ siddhalakṣmīṃ namāmi || <2> || 

icchāśakti prathamalaharīmasurāntaḥ pravāhāṃ garbhībhūtāṃ trividhamuditāṃ pañcadhā prasphurantīm | 

samyagdevīṃ sphaṭikadhavalāṃ śuddhakundenduvarṇāṃ rudrārūḍhāṃ daśabhujayutāṃ kṣāmagātrīṃ namāmi 
|| <3> || 

oṃ hrīṃ śrīṃ kulagaṇapatināthapāda | oṃ kula gaṇapativalyabhāmbāpāda | oṃ vaṭukanāthapāda | oṃ 
vaṭukavalyabhāmbāpāda | oṃ gaṅgāmbāpāda | oṃ yamunāmbāpāda | iti dvārapūjā || 

atha guru kramaḥ | 

oṃ hrīṃ śrīṃ paramaśivanāthapāda | oṃ śivanāthapāda | oṃ ekanettranāthapāda | oṃ kālāgni rudranāthapāda 

oṃ śrīkaṇṭhanāthapāda | oṃ pārvatī ambāpāda | oṃ daśakaṇṭha(kandara)nāthapāda | oṃ 
dīpikācāryanāthapāda | oṃ andhakāsuranāthapāda | oṃ jayadrathanāthapāda | oṃ caryānandanāthapāda | oṃ 
sundaranāthapāda | oṃ gaganabhūtināthapāda | oṃ indrabhūtināthapāda | oṃ bhāskaranāthapāda | oṃ 
padmādevyambāpāda | oṃ svagurunāthapāda | iti gurukramaḥ || 

athāsanapūjā 

hrīṃ śrīṃ ādhāraśaktyai namaḥ | oṃ anantāya | oṃ dhātryai | oṃ surārṇavāya | oṃ padmāsanāya | oṃ hūṃ 
rudrāsanāya namaḥ | oṃ pretāsanāya || 

hrīṃ śrīṃ aṃ āṃ iṃ īṃ uṃ ūṃ ṛṃ ṝṃ ḷṃ ḹṃ eṃ aiṃ oṃ auṃ aṃ aḥ kadambavāgīśvaryai namaḥ | 

hrīṃ śrīṃ kaṃ khaṃ gaṃ ghaṃ ṅaṃ haṃsa vāgīśvaryai namaḥ | hrīṃ śrīṃ caṃ chaṃ jaṃ jhaṃ ñaṃ 
cittrāvāgīśvaryai namaḥ | oṃ ṭaṃ ṭhaṃ ḍaṃ ḍhaṃ ṇaṃ medhāvāgīśvaryai namaḥ | oṃ taṃ thaṃ daṃ dhaṃ 
naṃ vedyāvāgīśvaryai namaḥ | oṃ paṃ phaṃ baṃ bhaṃ maṃ bhogyāvāgīśvaryai namaḥ | 


oṃ yaṃ raṃ laṃ vaṃ subhagāvāgīśvaryai namaḥ | oṃ śaṃ ṣaṃ saṃ haṃ gaurīvāgīśvaryai namaḥ || 

vargāṣṭakaṃ dalāṣṭake | tadupari mūlavidyayā | tatrādau tāvadātmano nyāsaṃ kuryāt | vakṣyamāṇakrameṇa 
|| 

oṃ namaḥ sarvasiddhiyoginībhyo namaḥ | sarvasiddhimātṛbhyo | namo nityoditānandananditāyai 
sakalakulacakranāyikāyai bhagavatyai caṇḍakāpālinyai | 

tad yathā 

oṃ hrīṃ hrūṃ hāṃ pheṃ kṣoṃ kroṃ namaḥ | oṃ parama haṃsini nirvāṇamārgadeviṣamopaplava praśamani 
sakaladuritāriṣṭa kleśa dalani sarvāpada'mbhodhitaraṇi sakalaśatrupramathini devi āgaccha <2> hasa <2> valga <2> 
nararudhirāntravasābhakṣiṇi mama svaśatrūnmarda <2> khāhi <2> triśūlena bhindi <2> chindi <2> khaḍgena tāḍaya <2> 
cchedaya <2> tāvadyāvanmama sakalamanorathānsādhaya <2> paramakāruṇike bhagavati | 

mahābhairavarūpadhāriṇi tridaśavaranamite sakalamantramātaḥ praṇatajanavatsale devi mahākāli kālanāśini 
huṃ huṃ huṃ prasīdamadanāturāṃ kuru kuru surāsura kanyakāṃ hrīṃ śrīṃ hāṃ hūṃ phaṭ phaṭ phaṭ 
svāhā || 

varṇāḥ <29> 

[iti siddhalakṣmī mūlavidyā] | 

[athāsya nyāsapaddhati likhyate] || 

oṃ namaḥ sarvasiddhiyoginībhyaḥ | pūrvavaktrāya namaḥ | pūrvavaktre nyaset | oṃ namaḥ sarvasiddhimātṛbhyo 
dakṣiṇavaktrāya namaḥ | namo nityoditānandananditāyai vāmavaktrāya namaḥ | sakalakulacakranāyikāyai 
paścimavaktrāya namaḥ | bhagavatyai caṇḍakāpālinyai ūrdhvavaktrāya namaḥ | ta āsye | dya hṛdi | thā nābhau 
| oṃ āsye | hrīṃ vāmanāsāpuṭe | hūṃ dakṣiṇanāsāpuṭe | hāṃ vāmanettre | pheṃ dakṣiṇanettre | kṣoṃ 
vāmakarṇe | kroṃ dakṣiṇakarṇe | na hṛdaye | maḥ dvādaśānte | etanmuṇḍakrameṇa 

<sc, <9>, p. <61>>

navadvāreṣu nyaset | oṃ paramahaṃsini hṛdayāya namaḥ | nirvāṇamārgade śira0 | viṣamopaplava praśamani 
śikhā | sakalarduritāriṣṭa kleśadalani kava | sarvāpadambodhitaraṇi nettrā | sakalaśatru pramathini astrā | 

iti ṣaḍaṅganyāsaḥ | 

anenaivāstra mantreṇa digbandhanādikaṃ kuryāt | 

oṃ devi āgaccha <2> hasa <2> valga <2> nararudhirāntravasā bhakṣiṇikādyāya namaḥ | 

dakṣiṇahaste 

