āgneye | oṃ hrīṃ hūṃ kṣīṃ agnivetālāya namaḥ | dakṣe | aiṃ hrīṃ kṣūṃ hūṃ agnijihvāya namaḥ | 
nair(-)ṛte | oṃ hrīṃ hrīṃ hūṃ kurparāya namaḥ | paścime | kālāya namaḥ | vāyau | oṃ kṣā yūṃ kṣīṃ 
karāline namaḥ | uttare | oṃ āṃ yūṃ kṣmīṃ ekapādāya namaḥ | aiśe | oṃ kṣūṃ yūṃ kṣāṃ bhīmarūpāya 
namaḥ | madhye | ūrdhve ḍāmarāya namaḥ | adhaḥ hāṭakeśvarāya namaḥ || 

atha visarjanam | 

ājñāṃ me dīyatāṃ nātha naivedyasyāsya bhakṣaṇe | śarīrayātrā siddhyarthaṃ kṣamasva parameśvara || 

oṃ hūṃ bhagavan kṣamasva hūṃ phaṭ | hūṃ bhagavati kṣamasva hūṃ phaṭ | 

yat kiñcit kurmahe deva sadāsukṛta duṣkṛtam | tanme śivapadasthasya hūṃ haḥ kṣapaya śaṅkara || 

kṣaḥ kṣaḥ kṣapaya śaṅkaretyapi pāṭhaḥ | etāvatya smadarthe śakṣantavyaṃ kheditosibhoḥ | 

iti kṣāntimantraḥ | 

jvālārūpaṃ samutthāya praśāntaparamātamaneḥ | dhyāyedarceśca santuṣṭaṃ praṇamedādarāśśivam || 

kṣamasva nyūnādhika bhāvayuktaṃ mayākṛtaṃ darśaya viśvamūrte | prasīda deveśa namostubhyaṃ prayāhi 
tuṣṭaḥ punarāgamāya | 

dravyahīnaṃ kriyāhīnaṃ mantrahīnaṃ ca yadgatam | tatsarvaṃ pūrṇatāṃ pātu tvat prasādān maheśvara || 

tataḥ pūjitamantrān sphurad vahnikaṇābhānvibhau līnān dhyātvā | taṃ ca vibhuṃ jvālārūpaṃ hṛtsthaṃ 
bhāvayet | iti śivam | 

tatassamayā | tatorghapātraṃ svīkuryāt | tataḥ ekapādaṃ | karālini | taṃ kālākhye | tamagni jihve | tamagni 
vetāle | taṃtripurāntake | tamāmardake | taṃ mudgare | taṃ paraśau | taṃ daṇḍe | taṃ vajre | tattriśūle | 
tadghaṇṭāyāṃ | tāṃ ḍamarau | taṃ vīṇāyām | tāṃ khaṭvāṅge | taṃ kapāle | tadabhaye abhayaṃ vare | 
varaṃ pināke | pinākaṃ śare | śaramaṅkuśe | aṅkuśaṃ pāśe | taṃ kheṭake | taṃ khaḍge | khaḍgamīśāne 
| taṃ kuvīre | taṃ vāyau | taṃ varuṇe | taṃ nair(-)ṛte | taṃ yametaṃ agnau | tamiṃdre | indraṃ 
vidyārājabhairave | taṃ somarājabhairave | taṃ meghanādabhairave | taṃ manmathabhairave | taṃ vikarālabhairave 
| taṃ krodharājabhairave | taṃ śikhivāhanabhairave | taṃ kapāleśabhairave līnaṃ bhāvayet | 
prāgvatkapāleśabhairavaṃ | āmardake līnaṃ bhāvayet | āmardakaṃ śaktau | śakti'mastre | astraṃ netre | 
netraṃ kavace | kavacaṃ śikhāyāṃ śikhāṃ śivasi | śiro hṛdayadeśe | hṛdayaṃ sadyojāte sadyojātaṃ 
vāmadeve | vāmadevamaghore | taṃ tatpuruṣe | tamīśāne | taṃ sakalabhaṭṭārake | taṃ niṣkalamantreśvare | 
tamarghapātre | arghapātraṃ svātmani līnaṃ bhāvayet | iṣṭvā śrīmatsvatantrokta kriyayābhairavaṃ budhāḥ | 
labhantāṃ 


tanmayībhāvaṃ sadāsvātantrya siddhaye | vigalati bhavadaurgatyaṃ mokṣa śrīḥ | śrayati hṛtkajaṃ kacati | 
prasarati paramānando | yatra tadīśārcanaṃ jayati | bhavatyapi pāṭhaḥ samāpteyaṃ svacchandapatrikā 
svātmabhairavabhaṭṭāraka prītaye bhūyāditi śivam || 

athasamayā || 

vidhilopanivāraṇārthaṃ samayā pūjyā || 

oṃ juṃ saḥ amṛteśāya amṛtamūrtaye sarvabhūtāntarātmane mahāvyomaśarīrāya sarvasamayalopānnivāraya 
samayaṃ prapūraya sarvasādhāraṇa mantraśarīrāya hrīṃ svāhā | oṃ hrīṃ amṛte parāmṛte nitya klīṃ saḥ 
amṛteśvarī sarvabhūtāntarasthe brahmasvarūpe mahāvyomaśarīre sarvasamayalopānnivāraya sarvasamayaṃ 
prapūraya amṛtalakṣmyai svāhā | oṃ hūṃ śāntajñāna svarūpāya hāṃ hīṃ hūṃ haiṃ hauṃ haḥ 
sarvasamayalopanivārakāya hrīṃ svāhā | iti svacchandasamayā | oṃ aghore juṃ tha ghore saḥ ghoraghoratare | 
hrīṃ sarvataḥ śarvasarve | hūṃ namaste rudrarūpe astrāya phaṭ | oṃ aghore sarvātmane hṛdayāya namaḥ | oṃ 
juṃ tha ghore brahmaśisare svāhā | saḥ ghoraghoratare jvāliniśikhāyai vauṣaṭ | oṃ hrīṃ sarvataḥ 
śarvasarvepiṅgalāya kavacāya huṃ hūṃ namaste rudrarūpe durbhedyāya pāśupatāstrāya phaṭ | ityut 
kīlanavidyā | aghorasyot kīlanam | 

oṃ aghore aiṃ tha ghore hrīṃ ghoraghoratare śrīṃ sarvataḥ sarvasarve | phreṃ rudrarūpe hsphreṃ namaste | 

bhakārasahitaṃ mantraṃ namaste madhya saṃsthitam | aṣṭaukīlāmayādattāstenāsau naiva siddhyati || 

eteṣu sarvatantreṣu vīryahīnaṃ prakāśitam | jīvaprāṇavinirmuktaṃ pañcabījavivarjitam || 

athāmṛtīsvarapūjanam || 

oṃ amṛteśāyavidmahe mahādevāyadhimahi | tannorudraḥ pracodayāt <3> || 

dravyaśuddhidigbandhana prāṇāyāmādi vidhāya karāṅganyāsaṃ kṛtvā dhyāyet | 

haṃ mūrtaye namaḥ | 

devaṃ tāmarasāsanaṃ śaśikalālaṅkāramaṅkāramacchaṅkhāmbhojalasadvarābhaya mahālakṣmī samudbhāsitam | 
savyāsavyakadovarābhaya sudhākumbhendumindūlasatsaumyāsyaṃ ca caturbhujaṃ ca bhagavannetraṃ trinetraṃ numaḥ | 

mānasaiḥ pādyādibhiḥ pūjanam | 

oṃ juṃ saḥ amṛteśvarabhairavāya namaḥ | oṃ juṃ hṛdayāya | oṃ vyoṃ śira | oṃ īṃ śikhā | oṃ hnūṃ kava | 
oṃ jyoṃ netre | oṃ phaṭ astrā | oṃ juṃ saḥ amṛtalakṣmyai namaḥ | śrīdevyaṅgāni śrīdevavat | oṃ 
śivatatvāya namaḥ | oṃ juṃ vidyātatvāya | oṃ saḥ ātmatatvāya namaḥ | indrādi lokapālebhyo namaḥ | 
brāhmyādi mātṛbhyo namaḥ | ityādi || 


oṃ vibhraddorbhiḥ kuṭhāraṃ mṛgamabhayavarau suprasannomaheśaḥ sarvālaṅkāradīptassarasijanilayo vyāghracarmā 
vāsaḥ | dhyeyo muktāparāgāmṛtarasakalaitādri prabhaḥ pañcavaktrastryakṣaḥ koṭīrakoṭīghaṭita tu 
hinarociṣkalātuṅgamauliḥ | 

asyamantrasya | 

vāmadeva ṛṣiḥ paṅkticchandaḥ | ī śodevatā ātmana iṣṭasiddhyarthaṃ viniyogaḥ | 

oṃ namaḥ śivāya | oṃ hṛ | na śira | maḥ śikhā | śi kava | vā netre | ya astrāya | na īśānamūrdhne namaḥ 
| maḥ tatpuruṣavaktrāya namaḥ | śi aghorahṛdayāya namaḥ | vā vāmadevaguhyāya namaḥ | ya sadyojātamūrtaye 
namaḥ | na ūrdhvavaktrāya namaḥ | maḥ pūrvavaktrāya namaḥ | śi dakṣiṇavaktrāya namaḥ | vā uttaravaktrāya 
namaḥ | ya paścimavaktrāya namaḥ | āvṛtirādyā mūrtibhiraṅgairanyā parāpyanantādyaiḥ aparomādyaiḥ 
aparendrādyairaparā tadāyudhaiḥ proktā | oṃ śarvāya devāya kṣitimūrtaye namaḥ | oṃ bhavāya devāya 
jalamūrtaye namaḥ | oṃ rudrāya devāya agnimūrtaye namaḥ | oṃ ugrāya devāya vāyumūrtaye namaḥ | oṃ bhīmāya 
devāya ākāśamūrtaye namaḥ | oṃ paśupataye devāya yajamānamūrtaye namaḥ | 

oṃ mahādevāya somamūrtaye namaḥ | oṃ īśānāya devāya sūryamūrtaye namaḥ | madhye durgāyai namaḥ | 

tatoṅgāni | tataḥ anantāya namaḥ | ityādi | 

umāyai namaḥ | ityādi | 

indrāya vajrahastāya nama | ityādi | 

vajrāya phaṭityādi | iti pañcākṣara pūjanam | 

hāṃ nivṛtti kalādhipataye brahmaṇe namaḥ | hīṃ pratiṣṭhākalādhipataye viṣṇave namaḥ | hūṃ 
vidyakalādhipataye rudrāya namaḥ | haiṃ śāntākalādhipataye īśvarāya namaḥ | haḥ 
śāntyatītākalādhipataye sadāśivāya namaḥ | oṃ mantrādhvane namaḥ | oṃ padādhvane namaḥ | varṇādhvane | 
bhuvanādhvane namaḥ | tattvādhvane | oṃ kalādhvane namaḥ || 

oṃ sakalākalo vimiśraḥ sadasatsarveśvaro mahāmantraḥ | tamihamahāpāpaharaṃ paśupāśajīghāṃsakaṃ vande | 
tanmaheśāya vidmahe vyomarūpāya dhīmahi | tanno namaḥ śivaḥ pracodayāt <3> | 

