oṃ namaḥ sarvātmane śarāya parameśvarāya yogāya yogasambhavāya kara <2> kuru <2> sadya <2> bhava <2> bhavodbhava 
vāmadeva sarvākāryaprasamana namostute svāhā hṛdayāya namaḥ | 

svaśivaśira namaḥ | śirase svāhā | śivahṛdaya jvālinyai svāhā | śikhāyai vauṣaṭ | oṃ śivātmakaṃ 
mahātejassavajñamaparājitam | āvartaye mahāghoraṃ kavacaṃ piṅgalaṃ śubham | kavacā vāhanam | āyāhi 
piṅgala mahākavaca śivājñayā hṛdayaṃ bandha <2> ghūrṇa <2> kā ki <2> sūkṣma <2> vajradhara <2> vajrapāśa 
