tatra gāyatrī | 

śivātmakamidaṃ viśvaṃ śivādeva pravartate | śivāya śivagarbhāya śivassarvaṃ pracodayāt <3> || 

īśānassarvavidyānāmīśvarassarvabhūtānām | brahmādhipatirbrahmaṇodhipatirbrahmāśivomestu sadāśiva oṃ | 

oṃ hūṃ amogha svāhā phaṭ hṛda pañcamūrti ne namaḥ | śira | īśāne svāhā śikhā | oṃ jvalanti namaḥ phaṭ 
kavacāya hūṃ sadasadom phaṭ astrāya | tatpuruṣāya vidmahe mahādevāyadhīmahi | tannorudraḥ pracodayāt <3> | 


